Photorealistic military avionics radar medallion, square composition, viewed directly straight-on, isolated on a pure flat black background (#000000), centered and filling 80 percent of the canvas. One circular object, half precision cockpit azimuth dial, half vinyl record. Rim: matte arctic-white ceramic gimbal ring with fine 360-degree compass degree tick marks and a thin ring of glowing hazard-amber avionics light just inside it. Face: dark carbon-composite turntable with fine concentric audio grooves and a glass targeting reticle center boss. On the face, two centered lines of crisp glowing stencil lettering in amber cockpit light: first line "Killa", second line "YuE" (capital Y, lowercase u, capital E). High-contrast tactical avionics craftsmanship, macro photography, crisp focus, symmetrical. No other text, no watermark.
